>Miamba ni visiwa ambavyo havina ukanda wowote wa baharini</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Miamba ni visiwa ambavyo haviwezi kukimu makazi ya binadamu au maisha yao ya kiuchumi na kwa mujibu wa kifungu cha 121 (3) havina Ukanda wa Kiuchumi Pekee au rafu ya bara.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Miamba ni visiwa vidogo vinavyoweza kukimu makazi ya binadamu</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Miamba ni visiwa ambavyo haviwezi kukimu makazi ya binadamu au maisha yao ya kiuchumi na kwa mujibu wa kifungu cha 121 (3) havina Ukanda wa Kiuchumi Pekee au rafu ya bara. [Subject: International Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>0b83baa4e3d3c60d75f1...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248371 · SUBHISTWOR_Q507687</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">COUNTRY_LOCAL: China</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HIST_WORLD — World History (Modern World, Revolutions, World Wars &amp; Decolonization)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Civil Services &amp; GS</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School World History (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School World History</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Swali hili linarejelea habari zifuatazo.\n“Wareno wanapotoka Macao nchini China kwenda Japan, wanabeba hariri nyingi, dhahabu, maski na kauri: nao hawachukui chochote kutoka nchini Japan ila fedha. Wana meli kubwa inayoenda huko kila mwaka na kuleta kutoka huko karibu sarafu mia sita: na fedha hii yote ya Japan, na sarafu laki mbili zaidi za fedha ambayo wanatoa kila mwaka kutoka India, wanatumia kwa faida kubwa nchini China: na wanaleta kutoka huko dhahabu, maski, hariri, shaba, kauri, na vitu vingine vingi vya bei ghali na vya utajiri.\nWareno wanapokuja Canton nchini China kufanya biashara, wanapaswa kubaki humo ila kwa siku fulani: na wanapokuja kwenye lango la mji, lazima waandike majina yao katika kitabu, na wanapotoka nje usiku ni lazima waondoe majina yao. Hawapaswi kulala mjini usiku kucha, wanapaswa kulala kwenye mashua zao nje ya mji. Na, baada ya muda wao kwisha, ikiwa mtu yeyote anabaki hapo, anafungwa jela.”\nRalph Fitch, simulizi la safari za Mashariki ya Mbali, 1599 C.E.\nNi gani kati ya matukio yafuatayo kutoka kipindi cha 1750–1900 C.E. yalikuwa na uwezekano zaidi wa kubatilisha mienendo ya biashara iliyotajwa katika fungu la kwanza?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ugunduzi wa bidhaa fulani ambazo Wachina walitaka kununua kutoka kwa wafanyabiashara wa Ulaya</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mapinduzi ya elimu barani Ulaya na Amerika</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mapinduzi ya Viwanda</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kutia ukoloni Afrika</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ugunduzi wa bidhaa fulani ambazo Wachina walitaka kununua kutoka kwa wafanyabiashara wa Ulaya [Subject: High School World History · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>94d84d611eda4ecb56d1...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248370 · SUBHISTWOR_Q507685</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HIST_WORLD — World History (Modern World, Revolutions, World Wars &amp; Decolonization)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Civil Services &amp; GS</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School World History (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School World History</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Swali hili linarejelea habari zifuatazo.\nAlinichukua, akanipeleka chini kwenye Nyumba ya Giza…\nKwenye nyumba ambamo wale wanaoingia ndani hawatoki nje,\nKwenye barabara ya kutoweza kurudi,\nKwenye nyumba ambayo wale wanaokaa humo, hawana mwanga,\nAmbapo mavumbi ndio kinywaji chao, chakula chao ni udongo…\nAmbapo nuru haionekani. Wanakaa gizani,\nNa kwenye mlango na komeo, kuna mavumbi.\nkutoka kwenye Tablet VII, The Epic of Gilgamesh, Sumeria, karibu mwaka 2100 B.C.E.\nUkweli ni mzuri na thamani yake inadumu.\nHaijavurugwa tangu siku ya muumba wake,\nIlhali yule anayekiuka amri zake huadhibiwa.\nImenyooka kama njia hata mbele ya yule asiyejua chochote.\nMakosa kamwe hayajaleta mawindo yake bandarini…\nWale wanaoongozwa na miungu hawawezi kupotoka.\nWale ambao wanawanyima njia hawataweza kuvuka mto wa uzima.\nkutoka kwenye The Maxims of Ptahhotep, Misri, karibu mwaka 2400 B.C.E.\nAya hizo mbili zinaunga mkono hitimisho gani kati ya mahitimisho yafuatayo?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wamisri wa kale hawakuwa na maoni mabaya sana juu ya maisha baada ya kifo kama Wasumeri walivyofanya.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wamisri wa kale walikuwa na mwelekeo zaidi kuliko Wasumeri wa kuona utiifu wa kisiasa kama maadili bora.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wamisri wa kale walikuwa na mfumo dume zaidi katika mahusiano yao ya kijinsia kuliko Wasumeri.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wamisri wa kale waliteseka chini ya ngazi thabiti zaidi za matabaka ya kijamii kuliko Wasumeri wa kale.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Wamisri wa kale hawakuwa na maoni mabaya sana juu ya maisha baada ya kifo kama Wasumeri walivyofanya. [Subject: High School World History · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>bc59d875e330bf466944...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248369 · SUBHISTWOR_Q507684</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">COUNTRY_LOCAL: China</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HIST_WORLD — World History (Modern World, Revolutions, World Wars &amp; Decolonization)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Civil Services &amp; GS</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School World History (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School World History</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Swali hili linarejelea habari zifuatazo.\nNi kwa sababu ya kanuni gani, basi, wageni hawa wanapaswa kutuma dawa yenye sumu? Bila kumaanisha kwamba wageni hawa wana nia mbovu katika mioyo yao, bado tunasisitiza kwamba kwa sababu ya uchu wao mkubwa wa kupata faida, hawajali kabisa maumivu wanayotuletea! Na kwa kuwa hali iko hivyo, tunauliza ni nini kimeipata dhamiri ambayo mbingu zimepanda katika vifua vya watu wote? Tumesikia kwamba katika nchi yenu wenyewe bangi imepigwa marufuku kwa ukali sana. Huu ni uthibitisho imara kwamba mnajua vizuri sana madhara yake kwa binadamu. Kwa kuwa hamruhusu iwadhuru watu wa nchi yenu wenyewe, hampaswi kuruhusu dawa hii yenye madhara kupelekwa kwenye nchi nyingine, na zaidi ya yote, sembuse kwenye Nchi ya Ndani! Kati ya bidhaa ambazo China inauza kwenye nchi zenu za kigeni, hakuna hata moja ambayo haina faida kwa binadamu kwa namna moja au nyingine.\nLin Zexu, kamishna wa biashara wa China, barua kwa Malkia Victoria, 1839\nMwandishi wa fungu hili anategemeza ombi lake juu ya hoja gani kati ya hoja zifuatazo?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ni unafiki kuiuzia nchi moja kitu chenye madhara ambacho kimepigwa marufuku katika nchi yako mwenyewe.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mafundisho ya Konfyushasi yanakataza matumizi ya madawa ya kulevya kwani ni kinyume cha maadili.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Uraibu unaifanya China ikumbwe na shughuli za biashara zenye usawaziko hasi.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Uingereza haifanyi busara kuchochea ghadhabu ya nchi ambayo ina nguvu zaidi za kijeshi.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ni unafiki kuiuzia nchi moja kitu chenye madhara ambacho kimepigwa marufuku katika nchi yako mwenyewe. [Subject: High School World History · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>8a357ed4d52f091d56a1...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248368 · SUBHISTWOR_Q507679</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HIST_WORLD — World History (Modern World, Revolutions, World Wars &amp; Decolonization)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Civil Services &amp; GS</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Us History (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Us History</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Swali hili linarejelea habari zifuatazo.\n&quot;Wamarekani wana uhuru zaidi na haki pana kuliko raia wa karibu mataifa mengine yote duniani, ikiwa ni pamoja na uwezo wa kuikosoa serikali yao na viongozi wao waliowachagua. Lakini hatuna haki ya kugeukia vurugu—au tishio la vurugu—tusipopata tutakachotaka. Waanzilishi wetu walijenga mfumo wa serikali ili akili iweze kushinda hofu. Mji wa Oklahoma ulithibitisha tena kwamba bila sheria hakuna uhuru. Ukosoaji ni sehemu ya uhai wa demokrasia. Hakuna aliye sawa wakati wote. Lakini tunapaswa kukumbuka kuwa kuna tofauti kubwa kati ya kukosoa sera au mwanasiasa na kuichafua serikali inayotuhakikishia uhuru wetu na watumishi wa umma wanaotekeleza sheria zetu.&quot;\nRais Bill Clinton, &quot;What We Learned in Oklahoma City,&quot; 2010\n(Imeandikwa katika kumbukumbu ya miaka 15 ya shambulio la bomu la Mji wa Oklahoma)\n&quot;Kama kusingekuwa na Waco, ningeweka mizizi mahali fulani na nisingekuwa na wasiwasi na ukweli kwamba serikali yangu ... ilikuwa tishio kwangu. Kila kitu ambacho Waco anamaanisha nilikea kipaumbele. Aina hiyo iliongoza mienendo yangu kwa miaka michache iliyofuata.&quot;\nTimothy McVeigh, Oklahoma City bomber, 2001\nMwakilishi wa Marekani John Conyers, Matukio Yanayozingira Mgogoro wa Itikadi ya Davidian huko Waco, Texas: Kusikiza Mbele ya Kamati ya Mahakama, Baraza la Wawakilishi, 1993\nDondoo zilizo hapo juu zinaunga mkono zaidi dokezo gani kati ya madokezo yafuatayo?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Katika miaka ya 1990, maoni ya kupinga serikali, kwa kujibu matumizi ya kupita kiasi ya mamlaka ya serikali kuu kutatua migogoro ya ndani, yalichochea makundi ya mgambo na sungusungu, kama vile Timothy McVeigh.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mwaka 1993 Mkuu wa Sheria Janet Reno alizindua mapambano dhidi ya farakano la Branch Davidian lililoongozwa na Timothy McVeigh, baadaye akikosolewa na Congress kwa hatua yake ya kutumia mabavu.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Akihofia kuibuka kwa maoni ya kupinga serikali baada ya shambulio la bomu kwenye Jiji la Oklahoma, Mkuu wa Sheria Janet Reno alipeleka majeshi kuzima Mapambano ya Farakano la Branch Davidian, kisha baadaye akakosolewa na bunge la Congress.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mkuu wa Sheria Janet Reno alijiuzulu kazi sababu moja ikiwa ni shinikizo kutoka Congress ambalo Mwakilishi John Conyers aliweka juu ya Rais Clinton.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Katika miaka ya 1990, maoni ya kupinga serikali, kwa kujibu matumizi ya kupita kiasi ya mamlaka ya serikali kuu kutatua migogoro ya ndani, yalichochea makundi ya mgambo na sungusungu, kama vile Timothy McVeigh. [Subject: High School Us History · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>9e1d27657abc198d4def...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248367 · SUBGENCORE_Q507668</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — High School Statistics</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Statistics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Statistics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Machungwa hamsini ya aina moja yalichaguliwa kwa nasibu na kupimwa uzito. Asilimia 95 ya utofauti wa uhakika uliochakatwa kutoka kwenye uzito wa sampuli ili kupima wastani wa uzito wa machungwa ya aina hii ni aunsi (7.58, 8.72). Je, ni maelezo gani kati ya haya yafuatayo ambayo ni ya kweli kwa kutegemea kiwango cha uhakika ambacho kimetumika?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Katika upangaji unaojirudia wa sampuli za ukubwa unaofanana, asilimia 95 ya utofauti (interval) ulioundwa utajumuisha wastani wa uzito wa kweli wa machungwa ya aina hii.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Katika upangaji unaojirudia wa sampuli za ukubwa unaofanana, asilimia 95 ya utofauti (interval) ulioundwa utajumuisha sampuli ya uzito wa wastani ya machungwa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Asilimia tisini na tano ya machungwa katika sampuli hii yana uzito wa kati ya aunsi 7.58 na 8.72.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Asilimia tisini na tano ya machungwa ya aina hii yana uzito wa kati ya aunsi 7.58 na 8.72.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Katika upangaji unaojirudia wa sampuli za ukubwa unaofanana, asilimia 95 ya utofauti (interval) ulioundwa utajumuisha wastani wa uzito wa kweli wa machungwa ya aina hii. [Subject: High School Statistics · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>e39e17b7e31917904344...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248366 · SUBGENCORE_Q507667</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — High School Statistics</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Statistics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Statistics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kibanda kidogo cha kuuzia bidhaa katika kiwanja cha ndege cha Atlanta huuza vitu vya ukumbusho kwa bei inayoanzia <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>3.99 hadi </mi></mrow></math>29.99, huku wastani wa bei ikiwa USD 14.75. Uongozi wa kiwanja unaamua kuongeza kodi inayotozwa kwa kibanda kwa asilimia 5. Ili kufidia ongezeko la kodi, mmiliki wa kibanda anaamua kuongeza bei ya vitu vyote kwa senti 50. Kutokana na hilo, kipi kati ya haya yafuatayo kitatokea?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bei ya wastani na utofauti wa bei utaongeza kwa senti 50.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bei ya wastani itabaki ile ile, lakini utofauti wa bei utaongezeka kwa senti 50.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bei ya wastani na mkengeuko wa kawaida wa bei utaongezeka kwa senti 50.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Bei ya wastani itaongezeka kwa senti 50, lakini mkengeuko wa kawaida wa bei utabaki ukiwa sawa.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Bei ya wastani itaongezeka kwa senti 50, lakini mkengeuko wa kawaida wa bei utabaki ukiwa sawa. [Subject: High School Statistics · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>8f3038f2e59ec47f2fa5...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248365 · SUBHUMPSYC_Q507662</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HUM_PSYCHOLOGY — Psychology (Cognitive, Developmental, Social, Clinical &amp; Research Methods)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Humanities</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Psychology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Psychology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Katika utafiti wa maendeleo ya ubongo, vikundi viwili vya panya vilitunzwa katika mandhari ya maabara. Katika Kikundi I, kila panya alitunza peke yake bila vitu vya kuchezea, wakati katika Kikundi II, panya waligawanywa katika vikundi vidogo na kupatiwa vitu vya kuchezea. Ni maelezo gani kati ya haya yanaakisi kwa usahihi matokeo ya utafiti huu?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Panya waliotunzwa katika Kikundi I watakuwa na ubongo wa mbele ambao una uzito mkubwa kuliko wa wale panya waliotunzwa katika Kikundi II.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Panya waliotunzwa katika Kikundi I watakuwa na ubongo wa mbele ambao hauna uzito mkubwa kuliko wale waliotunzwa katika Kikundi II.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ubongo wa panya waliotunzwa katika Kikundi I hautakuwa na utofauti wowote na ubongo wa wale panya waliolelewa katika Kikundi II.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ubongo wa panya waliotunzwa katika Kikundi I utakuwa na maada nyeupe nyingi zaidi, wakati ubongo wa panya waliotunzwa katika Kikundi II utakuwa na maada ya kijivu nyingi zaidi.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Panya waliotunzwa katika Kikundi I watakuwa na ubongo wa mbele ambao hauna uzito mkubwa kuliko wale waliotunzwa katika Kikundi II. [Subject: High School Psychology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>97fbf9b4d50f0b9af50c...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248364 · SUBHUMPSYC_Q507657</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HUM_PSYCHOLOGY — Psychology (Cognitive, Developmental, Social, Clinical &amp; Research Methods)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Humanities</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Psychology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Psychology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kipi kati ya haya yafuatayo kinaeleza kwa ubora ugunduzi wa bahati mbaya wa Ivan Pavlov?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wakati akifanya majaribio katika panya, Pavlov aligundua kwamba ikiwa ataweka vipande vya chakula kwa kurudia katika upande mmoja wa “mzingile-T,” panya wangekimbia moja kwa moja kwenye upande huo wa mzingile.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wakati akifanya majaribio katika mbwa, Pavlov aligundua kwamba mara tu mbwa wake walipozoea kumuona na kumsikia mhudumu ambaye alikuwa akiwaletea chakula wakati wa chakula, vinywa vyao vilijaa mate pale walipomwona na kusikia sauti ya mhudumu huyo.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wakati akifanya majaribio kwa paka, Pavlov aligundua kwamba ikiwa akiweka paka mwenye njaa katika kasha na chakula nje ya kasha, paka “angejifunza” kubofya wenzo ili kufungua mlango wa kasha.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Wakati akifanya majaribi na njiwa, Pavlov aligundua kwamba ikiwa angeweka njiwa katika kasha, angeweza kumfanya atambue kwamba angedonoa kitufe fulani, angeweza kupokea kipande cha chakula.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Wakati akifanya majaribio katika mbwa, Pavlov aligundua kwamba mara tu mbwa wake walipozoea kumuona na kumsikia mhudumu ambaye alikuwa akiwaletea chakula wakati wa chakula, vinywa vyao vilijaa mate pale walipomwona na kusikia sauti ya mhudumu huyo. [Subject: High School Psychology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>1965cfb196f9e0e34335...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248363 · SUBSCIPHYS_Q507644</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_SCI_PHYSICS — Physics (Classical Mechanics, Electromagnetism, Quantum, Optics &amp; Solid State)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Science</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Physics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Physics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Wakati maji ya moto yanatiwa ndani ya glasi iliyo na pombe baridi, halijoto ya mchanganyiko hatimaye itafikia halijoto sawia. Kwa kuzingatia mizani ya ukubwa wa molekuli za maji, ipi kati ya zifuatazo ni sababu kuu ya jambo hili?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Maji ya halijoto ya juu yatapanda juu ya chombo hadi yapozwe kisha yanachanganyika na pombe.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Molekuli za maji zinaendelea kuwa na nishati ya juu zaidi ya kinetiki kuliko molekuli za pombe, lakini vioevu hivyo viwili huchanganyika hadi nishati inasambazwa sawasawa katika chombo chote.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Maji moto yanatoa mionzi ya joto ambayo humezwa na pombe baridi hadi nishati ya kinetiki ya molekuli zote kuwa sawa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Molekuli za maji zinagongana na molekuli za pombe, na kuhamisha nishati hadi wastani wa nishati ya kinetiki ya molekuli za maji na pombe ziwe sawa.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Molekuli za maji zinagongana na molekuli za pombe, na kuhamisha nishati hadi wastani wa nishati ya kinetiki ya molekuli za maji na pombe ziwe sawa. [Subject: High School Physics · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>c567257d1faca800f4f4...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248362 · SUBGSINDIA_Q507638</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">COUNTRY_LOCAL: India</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GS_INDIAN_ECONOMY — Indian Economy, Economic Development, Planning, Budgeting &amp; Social Sector</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Civil Services &amp; GS</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Macroeconomics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Macroeconomics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kulingana na nadharia ya Mmonetari (Monetarist)</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mfumo wa Hifadhi ya Shirikisho (FED) unapaswa kufanya sera ya kif