gional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Sociology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Sociology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Kuhama kutoka kwa &#x27;dini ya kiraia&#x27; hadi &#x27;dini ya kawaida&#x27; kunamaanisha kwamba:</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">kuongezeka kwa urasimu wa serikali kumefanya dini kuwa sehemu ya kando tu ya maisha yetu</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">licha ya kudhoofika kwa mamlaka ya kimapokeo, maisha yetu ya kila siku na &#x27;akili ya kawaida&#x27; yanabakia kuongozwa na imani na maadili ya kidini.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">ushiriki wa kidini katika ibada ya pamoja unaweza kuwa umepungua, lakini watu bado wanafuata imani zao faraghani</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">watu wana uwezekano mkubwa wa kujadili imani zao za kidini hadharani, katika mazingira yasiyo rasmi</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) licha ya kudhoofika kwa mamlaka ya kimapokeo, maisha yetu ya kila siku na &#x27;akili ya kawaida&#x27; yanabakia kuongozwa na imani na maadili ya kidini. [Subject: Sociology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 O