do unasimamiwa kutoka msingi wa kijiografia. Hii inaashiria kuwa makundi ya kigaidi yana muundo wa kitaifa ambayo ina maana kwamba ugaidi hauwezi kuzingatiwa katika suala la vita vya kushindwa kijeshi bila ya kuwa na madhara makubwa kwa wakazi wa asili.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ugaidi unaweza kutazamwa kama tatizo la kutatuliwa kwa njia za kijeshi (vita dhidi ya ugaidi), kwa mbinu za kawaida za polisi (ugaidi kama uhalifu), au kama tatizo la kiafya lenye sababu na dalili za kimsingi (ugaidi kama ugonjwa).</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ugaidi unatazamwa kama tatizo la uhalifu. Kuharamishwa kwa ugaidi kuna athari mbili muhimu. Kwanza, inapendekeza kwamba ugaidi unaweza kutokomezwa - magaidi wanaweza kukamatwa na kufikishwa mahakamani kwa taratibu za kawaida za kimahakama na hivyo kuondoa tishio kutoka kwa jamii - na pili, inapendekeza kwamba mbinu za kuzuia uhalifu zinatumika kuzuia maendeleo yake.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Ugaidi unaweza kutazamwa kama tatizo la kutatuliwa kwa njia za kijeshi (vita dhidi ya ugaidi), kwa mbinu za kawaida za polisi (ugaidi kama uhalifu), au kama tatizo la kiafya lenye sababu na dalili za kimsingi (ugaidi kama ugonjwa). [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>f77eacf690bf1525ecb6...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248350 · SUBGENCORE_Q507530</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Je, tunawezaje kuelezea vyema uhusiano kati ya mbinu ya serikali na dhana ya usalama wa binadamu?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kuna migawanyiko mipana ndani ya mfumo wa usalama wa binadamu kuhusu asili ya vitisho na vitu vinavyorejelewa hivi kwamba hakuna ulinganisho unaotumika sana kati ya mbinu za serikali na usalama wa binadamu unaweza kuchorwa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kwa kupitisha mfumo wa usalama wa binadamu, vikwazo vya mkabala wa uhalisia wa hali halisi huwa dhahiri. Ingawa usalama wa binadamu unafafanua kitu kinachorejelewa kama mtu au idadi ya watu, mikabala inayozingatia serikali inatanguliza usalama wa nchi, na kutoweka kipaumbele katika kutafuta usalama wa binadamu.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mtazamo wa hali ya juu wa usalama ni kikundi cha usalama wa binadamu, kawaida hufafanuliwa ndani ya shule pana ya usalama wa binadamu. Kwa kuwa kitovu cha serikali mbinu hii huweka kipaumbele mtu binafsi kama kitu kinachorejelewa katika masomo ya usalama.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Mbinu zote mbili za msingi za serikali na za kibinadamu kwa usalama ni za kipekee na hutoa mfumo wa kutosha wa uchanganuzi ambao unaweza kuelewa mfumo wa usalama wa kimataifa. Kwa hivyo ni jukumu la wachambuzi wa usalama kuamua ni ipi kati ya dhana hizi muhimu ni sahihi, na ambayo inapaswa kutupwa.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Kwa kupitisha mfumo wa usalama wa binadamu, vikwazo vya mkabala wa uhalisia wa hali halisi huwa dhahiri. Ingawa usalama wa binadamu unafafanua kitu kinachorejelewa kama mtu au idadi ya watu, mikabala inayozingatia serikali inatanguliza usalama wa nchi, na kutoweka kipaumbele katika kutafuta usalama wa binadamu. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>b064b646d5400322ffbf...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248349 · SUBGENCORE_Q507529</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ili kupata usalama, tishio lazima liwasilishwe kwa njia gani kati ya hizi?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kama tishio lililopo ambalo linahitaji hatua ya haraka na isiyo ya kawaida, na kusababisha tishio kwa maisha ya serikali au kwa usalama wa jamii.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kama kuhitaji hatua ya haraka na ya ajabu na serikali, kutishia maisha ya kitu referent na hivyo kuhalalisha matumizi ya hatua si kawaida kuajiriwa katika ulimwengu wa kisiasa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kama tishio la haraka kwa maisha ya kitu cha mrejeleo, ni mbaya sana hivi kwamba inahalalisha utumiaji wa hatua za kushangaza katika kujibu.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kama tishio la dharura kwa maisha ya hadhira ambayo inahitaji hatua za kushangaza au za dharura.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option C)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (C) Kama tishio la haraka kwa maisha ya kitu cha mrejeleo, ni mbaya sana hivi kwamba inahalalisha utumiaji wa hatua za kushangaza katika kujibu. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>ef4ebd18897d7123f1f1...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248348 · SUBGENCORE_Q507527</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — Security Studies</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Security Studies (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Security Studies</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ni nini kinachotofautisha diplomasia ya kulazimisha kutoka kwa jeshi?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ushuru ni neno lingine la diplomasia ya kulazimisha, lakini linalojumuisha seti finyu ya vigezo; shuruti hufunika vitisho hivyo vinavyolenga kuanzisha hatua ya adui. Tishio la kulazimisha serikali kutoa sehemu ya eneo lake linaweza kuhesabiwa kuwa diplomasia ya kulazimisha, mradi tu tishio hilo litaanzisha hatua kabla ya diplomasia tendaji kuchukuliwa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Diplomasia ya kulazimisha inajumuisha vitisho vya nguvu ndogo ili kushawishi motisha ya adui kutii matakwa ya mlazimishaji. Ni mkakati wa ushawishi ambao unakusudiwa kupata utii: utumiaji wa nguvu kumshinda mpinzani kwanza hauhesabiki. Inaacha kipengele cha chaguo na lengo la kuzingatia, au kuendelea.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Nguvu za kijeshi, au tishio la nguvu za kijeshi, hutumia hofu kufikia malengo ya kimkakati. Diplomasia ya kulazimishwa inatofautishwa na mbinu hii, kwa sababu haitumii woga kama chombo cha kumshurutisha adui.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Diplomasia ya kulazimishwa inatumika kwa kutumia nguvu lakini kupunguza athari zake kwa jumuiya ya kimataifa. Diplomasia ya kulazimisha ni mkakati mkali ambao unakusudiwa kupata ufuasi kupitia kushindwa. Haiachi kipengele cha chaguo kwa walengwa, walengwa ama kulazimishwa kufuata au kushiriki katika migogoro. Inatafuta kudhibiti kwa kuweka uzingatiaji kwa kuondoa fursa yoyote ya mazungumzo au makubaliano.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option B)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (B) Diplomasia ya kulazimisha inajumuisha vitisho vya nguvu ndogo ili kushawishi motisha ya adui kutii matakwa ya mlazimishaji. Ni mkakati wa ushawishi ambao unakusudiwa kupata utii: utumiaji wa nguvu kumshinda mpinzani kwanza hauhesabiki. Inaacha kipengele cha chaguo na lengo la kuzingatia, au kuendelea. [Subject: Security Studies · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>1dc53a06118f4ed6c361...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248347 · SUBHUMPSYC_Q507517</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_HUM_PSYCHOLOGY — Psychology (Cognitive, Developmental, Social, Clinical &amp; Research Methods)</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Humanities</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Psychology (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Psychology</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Mmoja wa wateja wako wa tiba anauliza ushauri wako kuhusu mpango mzuri wa kupunguza uzito. Umechunguza programu katika jumuiya na umejiandikisha katika ile unayoona kuwa bora zaidi. Mpango huu unatoa bonasi ya USD 50 kwa wateja wake kwa kila mtu mpya wanayemleta kwenye programu. Chini ya hali hizi, jibu lako linalofaa zaidi litakuwa kwa</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">mwambie mteja wako faida na hasara za kila programu unayoijua isipokuwa ile ambayo umejiandikisha</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">pendekeza kwa mteja wako programu ambayo umejiandikisha na ueleze bonasi ya USD 50 utakayopokea</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">pendekeza kwa mteja wako mpango ambao umejiandikisha na ujitolee kuweka bonasi ya USD 50 kwenye akaunti ya mteja wako katika mpango huo.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">mwambie mteja wako faida na hasara za kila programu unayoijua, lakini usidai bonasi ya USD 50 ikiwa mteja wako anajiandikisha katika programu yako.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) mwambie mteja wako faida na hasara za kila programu unayoijua, lakini usidai bonasi ya USD 50 ikiwa mteja wako anajiandikisha katika programu yako. [Subject: Professional Psychology · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>bec1d926278ba47379bc...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248346 · SUBLAWCONS_Q507511</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Mwana alikuwa na deni la mkopeshaji <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mi>5,000. Baba ya mwana huyo aliwasiliana na mkopeshaji na kumwambia kwamba alitaka kulipa deni la mwana. Baba alitia saini hati iliyosema kwamba baba angelipa deni la mwana huyo kwa kiwango cha dola 500 kwa mwezi kwa miezi 10. Mkopeshaji hakufanya ahadi ya maandishi au ya mdomo ya kusitasita kumshtaki mwana wake ili kukusanya deni la dola 5,000, na baba huyo hakufanya ombi la mdomo au la maandishi la uvumilivu huo. Kwa muda wa miezi mitano iliyofuata, baba huyo alifanya na mkopeshaji akakubali malipo ya kila mwezi ya </mi></mrow></math>500 kama walivyokubaliana. Katika kipindi hicho, mkopeshaji, kwa kweli, hakuchukua hatua yoyote ya kisheria dhidi ya mwana. Hata hivyo, baba huyo alimjulisha mkopeshaji kwamba hangelipa tena deni hilo. Ni ipi kati ya zifuatazo ni hoja yenye ushawishi zaidi kwamba baba anawajibika kwa mkopeshaji chini ya masharti ya makubaliano yao?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Ahadi ya baba na tegemeo la mkopeshaji juu yake, ikiwa imethibitishwa, ilileta dai halali la mkopeshaji dhidi ya baba kulingana na fundisho la hati ya ahadi.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kwa sababu ilionekana kimbele kwamba ahadi ya baba ingemshawishi mkopeshaji aache kuchukua hatua yoyote dhidi ya mwana, uvumilivu huo ulikuwa, kama jambo la kisheria, ufikirio wa kulipwa kwa ahadi ya baba.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Malipo matano ya baba kwa mkopeshaji ya jumla ya USD 2,500 yalidhihirisha dhamira nzito kwa upande wa baba kuwa na dhamana ya kimkataba, na udhihirisho kama huo kwa ujumla unatambuliwa kuwa mbadala mzuri wa kuzingatiwa.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kwa kuchukua jukumu la deni la awali ambalo mwana alikuwa na deni kwa mkopeshaji, baba akawa mdhamini ambaye ahadi yake kwa mkopeshaji ilitekelezeka, kwa kuwa ilikuwa kwa maandishi na kuungwa mkono kwa kuzingatia vya kutosha.</div></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option A)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (A) Ahadi ya baba na tegemeo la mkopeshaji juu yake, ikiwa imethibitishwa, ilileta dai halali la mkopeshaji dhidi ya baba kulingana na fundisho la hati ya ahadi. [Subject: Professional Law · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>45c52d7806742c8b91ea...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248345 · SUBLAWCONS_Q507507</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_LAW_CONST — Constitutional &amp; Administrative Law</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Law</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> Professional Law (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> Professional Law</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Hivi majuzi bunge la jimbo limetunga sheria na kuifanya kuwa kosa kulaani au kutukana au kutumia lugha chafu au chafu kuelekea au kurejelea afisa wa polisi anayetekeleza majukumu yake. Mwanafunzi katika chuo kikuu cha serikali alipanga maandamano kwenye chuo kikuu kupinga vita. Mkutano huo ulihudhuriwa na kikundi cha wanafunzi 50 ambao walipiga kelele jumbe za kupinga vita kwa magari yaliyokuwa yakipita. Ili kuonyesha dharau yake kwa Marekani, mwanafunzi huyo alishona bendera ya Marekani kwenye sehemu ya nyuma ya suruali yake ya jeans. Afisa wa polisi alipoona bendera ikiwa imepandwa kwenye suruali ya jinzi ya mwanafunzi huyo, alimwendea na kumwambia aondoe bendera hiyo la sivyo atakamatwa. Mwanafunzi alikasirika na kumfokea afisa wa polisi, &quot;Sikiliza, mwanaharamu, nitavaa kitambaa hiki popote nipendavyo.&quot; Mwanafunzi huyo aliwekwa chini ya ulinzi na kushtakiwa kwa kukiuka sheria ya serikali. Mwanafunzi huyo baadaye anawasilisha kesi katika mahakama ya serikali akipinga uhalali wa sheria hiyo. Hoja kali ya kikatiba kwa mwanafunzi ni hiyo</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">sheria ni batili kwa uwazi chini ya Marekebisho ya Kumi na Nne ya mchakato kutokana na mchakato wa kutokana na kifungu.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">sheria ni batili kwa sababu inakiuka uhuru wa kujieleza wa mtumaji maombi chini ya Marekebisho ya Kwanza.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">sheria ni ufupisho wa uhuru wa kujieleza chini ya Marekebisho ya Kwanza kwa sababu njia zisizo na vizui