q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248333 · SUBGENCORE_Q507429</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — High School Statistics</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Statistics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Statistics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Baada ya onyo la baridi kali kutolewa, mwenye shamba kubwa la michungwa aliwaomba wafanyakazi wake wanyunyize miti yake yote kwa maji. Maji yalipaswa kuganda na kutengeneza kifuniko cha barafu kuzunguka maua ya machungwa. Hata hivyo, mwenye nyumba alishuku kuwa baadhi ya miti ilipata uharibifu mkubwa kutokana na baridi kali. Ili kukadiria idadi ya miti iliyopata uharibifu wa zaidi ya asilimia 50 kutokana na baridi kali, alichukua sampuli nasibu ya miti 100 kutoka kwa shamba lake. Je, ni tofauti gani ya majibu katika jaribio hili?</p></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"opts-grid\"><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">A</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Uwiano wa miti iliyopata uharibifu wa zaidi ya asilimia 50 kutokana na baridi.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">B</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Idadi ya miti iliyoathiriwa na barafu.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item \"><span class=\"opt-letter\">C</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Idadi ya miti iliyochukuliwa kutoka msituni.</div></div><div class=\"opt-item correct-opt\"><span class=\"opt-letter\">D</span><div class=\"opt-text\">Kwa kila mti uliotolewa, iwe ulipata uharibifu zaidi ya asilimia 50 au zaidi ya asilimia 50 ya uharibifu.</div><span class=\"corr-tag\">✓ Correct</span></div></div>\n      <details class=\"expl-box\">\n        <summary>View Explanation & Provenance (Answer: Option D)</summary>\n        <div class=\"expl-body\">\n          <p>Correct Answer: (D) Kwa kila mti uliotolewa, iwe ulipata uharibifu zaidi ya asilimia 50 au zaidi ya asilimia 50 ya uharibifu. [Subject: High School Statistics · Medium: EN].</p>\n          \n          <div class=\"hash-row\">\n            <span><strong>Source/License:</strong> HIGH_CONFIDENCE_SAFE (Apache-2.0 Open Multi-Language License) · CohereLabs/Global-MMLU-Lite</span>\n            <span><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code>78651db379e5c0f23aa0...</code></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </article>\n    \n    <article class=\"q-card\">\n      <div class=\"q-head\">\n        <div class=\"q-badges\">\n          <span class=\"badge b-id\">#248332 · SUBGENCORE_Q507427</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-db\">DB1_SCRAPED_MODIFIED</span>\n          \n          \n          \n          <span class=\"badge b-loc\">UNIVERSAL: ALL_COUNTRIES</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-subj\">SUB_GEN_CORE — High School Statistics</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-diff medium\">Medium</span>\n          <span class=\"badge b-pyq\">PYQ: Global &amp; Regional Medium Assessment (EN) ()</span><span class=\"badge b-meta\">Body: Apache-2.0 Global Academic Bank · India / Global</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q-meta\">\n          <span><strong>Domain:</strong> Multi-Disciplinary</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Unit:</strong> High School Statistics (EN Medium)</span> ·\n          <span><strong>Topic:</strong> High School Statistics</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"q-stem\"><p>Ni ipi kati ya zifuatazo ni taarifa sahihi kuh